┄ [C3], [W9] All □ of one alternative agree on its payload types, and a
┄ literal takes the type the others give that place.
control pick(a : u64) ■ { value {v : u64} }
⊤ ▷ s : ↻ once() {
    ⊤ ▷ t : ? a > 5
    t.true ▷ □ out {0}
    t.false ▷ □ out {a}
} ▸ out {v}
⊤ ▷ ■ value {v}

//! run pick(9) => done value {0}
//! run pick(3) => done value {3}
